{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52230","headline":"颂六十二首 五十五 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 五十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四生诚易转，五阴病难痊。\n寿报虽延促，终成丘墓尘。\n徒知饵六色，会当悲九泉。\n复愍轮回趣，难成不坏身。\n（见同书卷八九《五生部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}